%N A399373 Decimal expansion of exp(1+exp(1)+exp(1+exp(1))).
%C A399373 Decimal expansion of exp(1) * exp(exp(1)) * exp(exp(1)*exp(exp(1))).
%F A399373 Equals lim_{n->oo} exp(1 + s(n) + 2*n*(exp(s(n)) - (1 + 1/n)^(n*e))), where s(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} 1/k! = A061354(n)/A061355(n). - _Amiram Eldar_, Sep 05 2026
